id=unfuse_zygisk
name=Unfuse Zygisk
version=v1.4
versionCode=5
author=NIK2703
description=Direct internal storage for all apps — no FUSE, no scoped storage. vold's FUSE mount for emulated storage is replaced by a bind of the raw /data/media, Android/data + Android/obb isolation is lifted, and apps can execute files and create symlinks/hardlinks on storage when the optional SELinux rules are enabled.
